OL,3,GNEWSABowel cancer screening expanded -
OL,4,Abut 50 year olds face five year wait
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore people in Northern Ireland will be
OL,7,Foffered bowel cancer screening under
OL,8,Fplans to significantly expand the home
OL,9,Ftesting programme.
OL,11,FThe screening service is currently
OL,12,Favailable to people aged between 60 and
OL,13,F74.
OL,15,FBut from November, 59 year olds will
OL,16,Fbegin to be invited to take part, with
OL,17,Fthe age limit gradually reducing until
OL,18,Feveryone aged 50 to 74 is eligible by
OL,19,F2031.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
