OL,3,GNEWSABowel cancer screening expanded -
OL,4,Abut 50 year olds face five year wait
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn England, Scotland and Wales, people
OL,7,Faged between 50 and 74 are already
OL,8,Fautomatically sent a home screening
OL,9,Ftest every two years.
